      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-12-09T22:39:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Does anyone know if the character sheets will hold up to dry or wet erase markers so that they can be reused for different groups? It doesnt feel like pencil will do the job.</p><p>This would also let me track hero points on the sheet where it is intended, so it would be useful between issues as well as between groups.</p>",
