      "created_at": "2017-12-10T01:49:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I haven't tried it, but I would <strong><em>highly advise against it</em></strong>.</p><p>If you want to use the characters more than once, than I'd advise either xeroxing the second and third pge of the character booklets(the two you'd be doing any writing on) or just giving your players some scrap paper to write ther current HP, Boosts and other what-have-you on it.</p>",
