      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-12-10T02:30:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Better yet, buy a few binder sleeves from an office supply store (or a big-box store).&nbsp; Slide those character sheets into the binder sleeve, and you now have a surface usable with dry/wet erase markers, with no damage to the sheets themselves.</p><p>It's what I do with all my demo characters and pretty much every convention game I run.</p>",
