      "created_at": "2017-12-10T07:20:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>But you only need to write on the actual character sheet, yes?<br>\nSo hand players the booklet and say, “don’t write in this.” Then hand them a binder sleeved character sheet – you all have the pdf; just print out those specific pages – and tell them “write on this instead”.</p>",
