      "created_at": "2017-12-10T18:52:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Depending on how long you plan on playing with those particular sheets though, it may just be a better idea to just make copies every time you need them. Dry erase on those plastic covers won't really last in the long run, if you don't want your saved up hero points and other info that carries from session to session to rub away...</p>",
